--   moved or moved away from (_xero_stood_down). The accounting tables'
--   policies match by role (they matched nobody), rpc_accounting_disconnect
--   finds an administrator by profile, and rpc_accounting_encrypt and
--   rpc_accounting_decrypt are gone. A payment is recorded in Xero only for
--   the time an invoice was marked paid that the firm's own team stood
--   behind (_xero_vouch, _xero_may_pay, _xero_payment_left): their Mark as
--   Paid (which moves a push put off up to now), or their Push to Xero for
--   the marking their page showed (rpc_xero_push_now takes p_seen_status and
--   p_seen_paid_at), never the page a card payment returns to, whoever opens
--   it (rpc_mark_invoice_paid, pental.xero_no_vouch), and asked again as the
--   payment leaves (_xero_build); pushes queued before 1838 are finished
--   under the rules of then, once, on the upgrade; what Xero says of an
--   invoice (paid, voided) is asked before anything is sent; an invoice's
